  "_": "Per-family camera for the Furniture creation window's model icon, as [xan, yan]. The default is ^poh_menu_xan/^poh_menu_yan - three quarters on, from slightly above - which is right for anything with depth. A framed picture has none: seen from three quarters it is a one-pixel sliver. These families are turned face-on instead. Kitchen shelves and tool racks are walldecor too and are NOT in this list, because they do have depth and the default suits them.",
